        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tIqSt",
          "name": "Legend",
          "opacity": 0.45,
          "fill": "$o:muted-foreground",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 900,
          "content": "The last step is saved and the Done screen crossfades in (duration-base). Then the strip fills to black over duration-slow, and the pills turn lime one column at a time along the chain, trackers first, 40 ms apart. The buttons work from the first frame. Reduced motion: the Done screen arrives already black and lime.",
